d": "看了一下整个评论区，给我的感觉好像就是要用 Mac ，你得去看官网的教程，你得去了解各种插件，各种快捷方式，然后你还得熟悉使用触摸板。但是想想最早小时候接触 win ，好像没有那么多东西要学习的...像是自来熟一样，根本就不需要学习，拿起鼠标键盘就能用了，不知道各位有没有类似的感触？<br /><br />然后就是，国区账号非常不友好，想下一个东西，就是搜不到，之前为了连远程桌面下 Windows APP 就得切外区账户，除此之外别无其他安装方式，好多东西没有提供 dmg 安装包....像微软这边，就只需要把区域切成美国就好了", "last_modified": 1786179386, "replies": 79, "id": 1232881}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_large.png?m=1751736785", "name": "openai", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_normal.png?m=1751736785", "title": "OpenAI", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/openai", "topics": 4454, "footer": "", "header": "关于 OpenAI 旗下产品 GPT，DALL·E，和 ChatGPT 的讨论。请不要在 V2EX 的回复中粘贴复制来自 AI 生成的文本。", "title_alternative": "OpenAI", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_mini.png?m=1751736785", "stars": 3279, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 1135, "parent_node_name": "geek"}, "member": {"id": 414185, "username": "zw2019", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/zw2019", "website": "https://www.wmzhj.com", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "转过多少流年才相遇", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7296/b175/414185_mini.png?m=1573713224", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7296/b175/414185_normal.png?m=1573713224", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7296/b175/414185_large.png?m=1573713224", "created": 1558401152, "last_modified": 1573713224, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "bytewalk", "last_touched": 1786180081, "title": "codex 似乎要重置啦", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1232843", "created": 1786147875, "deleted": 0, "content": "快点重置吧 不然下周上班天才程序员要陨落啦\r\n\r\n![https://i.imgur.com/IgUsJ0u.png]( https://i.imgur.com/IgUsJ0u.png)\r\n\r\n![https://i.imgur.com/3W3V2Lo.png]( https://i.imgur.com/3W3V2Lo.png)", "content_rendered": "<p>快点重置吧 不然下周上班天才程序员要陨落啦</p>\n<p><img alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/IgUsJ0u.png\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IgUsJ0u.png\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/3W3V2Lo.png\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3W3V2Lo.png\"/></p>\n", "last_modified": 1786147875, "replies": 34, "id": 1232843}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/53e3/a716/693_large.png?m=1539037011", "name": "mechanical", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/53e3/a716/693_normal.png?m=1539037011", "title": "机械键盘", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/mechanical", "topics": 1162, "footer": "", "header": "机械键盘发烧友的讨论节点", "title_alternative": "Mechanical Keyboard", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/53e3/a716/693_mini.png?m=1539037011", "stars": 802, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 693, "parent_node_name": "hardware"}, "member": {"id": 1158, "username": "ybkjcxy", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/ybkjcxy", "website": "", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0c04/8b3a/1158_mini.png?m=1785813635", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0c04/8b3a/1158_normal.png?m=1785813635", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0c04/8b3a/1158_large.png?m=1785813635", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0c04/8b3a/1158_xlarge.png?m=1785813635", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0c04/8b3a/1158_xxlarge.png?m=1785813635", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0c04/8b3a/1158_xxxlarge.png?m=1785813635", "created": 1282392684, "last_modified": 1785813635, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "ybkjcxy", "last_touched": 1786181004, "title": "说说为什么明明只用一把键盘,家里还有七把", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1232899", "created": 1786171280, "deleted": 0, "content": "说个机械键盘的事,前几天又剁手了。\r\n\r\n本来说好这个月不买了的,结果晚上刷购物车,看到某轴体出了个新配色,手指头比脑子反应快,点了立即购买,付完款那三秒钟脑子才反应过来,又输了。\r\n\r\n家里现在攒了七把,常用的就一把,剩下六把摆柜子里,跟供着似的。我媳妇——啊不对不能提家里人,反正身边人问我这堆键盘干嘛用,我也说不上来,只能说\"手感不一样\"。什么叫不一样,其实我自己也说不清,可能就跟老烟枪分不清这包和那包烟有啥区别,但就是觉得不一样。\r\n\r\n最离谱的是有一阵子迷上了润轴,买了润滑剂、开轴器,一整套家伙事儿,拆了装装了拆,一把键盘捣鼓两周,代码倒是没写几行。产品经理天天在群里 at 我要进度,我心想再等等,这个轴还没调完呢。\r\n\r\n后来算了笔账,这几把键盘加起来的钱,够换个不错的显示器了,当场就跟自己说不买了。这话说完没俩月,某宝给我推了个联名限定轴体,标题写着\"仅剩最后 300 套\",我这人一看\"仅剩\"两个字就走不动道,又下单了。\r\n\r\n现在想通了,机械键盘对我们这行人来说,可能压根就不是打字工具,就是个能名正言顺花钱花时间、还不算不务正业的爱好——毕竟挂着\"生产力工具\"的名头,说出去体面。\r\n\r\n写到这儿突然想起购物车里还躺着一把没结账的,得,先去把它买了。", "content_rendered": "<p>说个机械键盘的事,前几天又剁手了。</p>\n<p>本来说好这个月不买了的,结果晚上刷购物车,看到某轴体出了个新配色,手指头比脑子反应快,点了立即购买,付完款那三秒钟脑子才反应过来,又输了。</p>\n<p>家里现在攒了七把,常用的就一把,剩下六把摆柜子里,跟供着似的。我媳妇——啊不对不能提家里人,反正身边人问我这堆键盘干嘛用,我也说不上来,只能说\"手感不一样\"。什么叫不一样,其实我自己也说不清,可能就跟老烟枪分不清这包和那包烟有啥区别,但就是觉得不一样。</p>\n<p>最离谱的是有一阵子迷上了润轴,买了润滑剂、开轴器,一整套家伙事儿,拆了装装了拆,一把键盘捣鼓两周,代码倒是没写几行。产品经理天天在群里 at 我要进度,我心想再等等,这个轴还没调完呢。</p>\n<p>后来算了笔账,这几把键盘加起来的钱,够换个不错的显示器了,当场就跟自己说不买了。这话说完没俩月,某宝给我推了个联名限定轴体,标题写着\"仅剩最后 300 套\",我这人一看\"仅剩\"两个字就走不动道,又下单了。</p>\n<p>现在想通了,机械键盘对我们这行人来说,可能压根就不是打字工具,就是个能名正言顺花钱花时间、还不算不务正业的爱好——毕竟挂着\"生产力工具\"的名头,说出去体面。</p>\n<p>写到这儿突然想起购物车里还躺着一把没结账的,得,先去把它买了。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1786171280, "replies": 33, "id": 1232899}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_large.png?m=1768280127", "name": "career", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_normal.png?m=1768280127", "title": "职场话题", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/career", "topics": 24047, "footer": "", "header": "这里，我们聊聊那些工作中遇到的开心和不开心的事。", "title_alternative": "Career", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_mini.png?m=1768280127", "stars": 3720, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 770, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 417579, "username": "dirstart", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/dirstart", "website": "", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "yuukiLike", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "给时光以生命，给岁月以文明", "bio": "https://github.com/yuukiLike", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/516f/d93f/417579_mini.png?m=1786106139", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/516f/d93f/417579_normal.png?m=1786106139", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/516f/d93f/417579_large.png?m=1786106139", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/516f/d93f/417579_xlarge.png?m=1786106139", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/516f/d93f/417579_xxlarge.png?m=1786106139", "created": 1559398940, "last_modified": 1786106139, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "dirstart", "last_touched": 1786170240, "title": "如何 vibe 成本那么低，什么才是护城河？或者我们需要护城河吗？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1232841", "created": 1786139584, "deleted": 0, "content": "最近看了很多新工具，确实也有做的非常棒的。\r\n很多基于 obsidian 的，基于本地屏幕录制、剪贴板的，可以说是百花齐放了。\r\n\r\ntibo 还没有重置，本人已经被 codex 使用完了，还想要被 AI 大人继续使用😭\r\n\r\nvibe 那么快，什么才是软件的护城河？", "content_rendered": "最近看了很多新工具，确实也有做的非常棒的。<br />很多基于 obsidian 的，基于本地屏幕录制、剪贴板的，可以说是百花齐放了。<br /><br />tibo 还没有重置，本人已经被 codex 使用完了，还想要被 AI 大人继续使用😭<br /><br />vibe 那么快，什么才是软件的护城河？", "last_modified": 1786156937, "replies": 25, "id": 1232841}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4299/8cf3/457_large.png?m=1583583838", "name": "gamedev", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4299/8cf3/457_normal.png?m=1583583838", "title": "游戏开发", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/gamedev", "topics": 471, "footer": "", "header": "无论你正在制作自己的 indie game，或是在大公司参与 AAA 大作，这里是大家讨论技术和理念的地方。", "title_alternative": "Game Development", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4299/8cf3/457_mini.png?m=1583583838", "stars": 772, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 457, "parent_node_name": "programmer"}, "member": {"id": 641874, "username": "shiyu2001", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/shiyu2001", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/924b/f35c/641874_mini.png?m=1786158942", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/924b/f35c/641874_normal.png?m=1786158942", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/924b/f35c/641874_large.png?m=1786158942", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/924b/f35c/641874_xlarge.png?m=1786158942", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/924b/f35c/641874_xxlarge.png?m=1786158942", "created": 1691154224, "last_modified": 1786158942, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "shiyu2001", "last_touched": 1786183969, "title": "Grok 4.5 做的江湖武侠游戏", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1232867", "created": 1786157919, "deleted": 0, "content": "前段时间发现 Grok 印度区年费只要 400 多，果断开通了。\r\n开通后想着拿来玩玩做游戏，结果效果出乎意料的好！\r\nGrok 生成游戏素材的效率真的太高了，Grok Build 也超级好用。整个游戏绝大部分内容都是用 Grok Build + Grok 4.5 生成的，只有部分素材用了 Image2~\r\n\r\n体验地址: https://wx.shiyu.dev\r\n欢迎来玩\r\n\r\n![b1sviAIGYsJcbgFKzAe7KrLWCbS4KZJS.webp]( https://cdn.nodeimage.com/i/b1sviAIGYsJcbgFKzAe7KrLWCbS4KZJS.webp)\r\n![ePXDChmB8xePxEsMUvP447ZCP6kmlPb8.webp]( https://cdn.nodeimage.com/i/ePXDChmB8xePxEsMUvP447ZCP6kmlPb8.webp)\r\n![nlxZi4ouE4CIvO9WxhRXVQS70YA4YDfq.webp]( https://cdn.nodeimage.com/i/nlxZi4ouE4CIvO9WxhRXVQS70YA4YDfq.webp)\r\n![pGXkYUmyYbMdJ3slZRElmEp5Fx5zEOKq.webp]( https://cdn.nodeimage.com/i/pGXkYUmyYbMdJ3slZRElmEp5Fx5zEOKq.webp)\r\n![baNEWedzTToUiaBFqw7KtcQQJw9vMwNv.webp]( https://cdn.nodeimage.com/i/baNEWedzTToUiaBFqw7KtcQQJw9vMwNv.webp)\r\n![yWiX3PTo83wfO0aRZq0Zt53c9D2a7GTd.webp]( https://cdn.nodeimage.com/i/yWiX3PTo83wfO0aRZq0Zt53c9D2a7GTd.webp)", "content_rendered": "<p>前段时间发现 Grok 印度区年费只要 400 多，果断开通了。\n开通后想着拿来玩玩做游戏，结果效果出乎意料的好！\nGrok 生成游戏素材的效率真的太高了，Grok Build 也超级好用。整个游戏绝大部分内容都是用 Grok Build + Grok 4.5 生成的，只有部分素材用了 Image2~</p>\n<p>体验地址: <a href=\"https://wx.shiyu.dev\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://wx.shiyu.dev</a>\n欢迎来玩</p>\n<p><img alt=\"b1sviAIGYsJcbgFKzAe7KrLWCbS4KZJS.webp\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nodeimage.com/i/b1sviAIGYsJcbgFKzAe7KrLWCbS4KZJS.webp\"/>\n<img alt=\"ePXDChmB8xePxEsMUvP447ZCP6kmlPb8.webp\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nodeimage.com/i/ePXDChmB8