 "content_rendered": "openai 成本感觉有点高", "last_modified": 1786156285, "replies": 18, "id": 1232858}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_large.png?m=1747623425", "name": "life", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_normal.png?m=1747623425", "title": "生活", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/life", "topics": 11422, "footer": "", "header": "生活中的技术讨论", "title_alternative": "Life", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_mini.png?m=1747623425", "stars": 2428, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 557, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 178336, "username": "zencitta", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/zencitta", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/992a5efa907e6a1a324c1c02ee582d58?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/992a5efa907e6a1a324c1c02ee582d58?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/992a5efa907e6a1a324c1c02ee582d58?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1466467402, "last_modified": 1715088186, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "6AbK2rj2vLBD", "last_touched": 1786183720, "title": "厄运专找苦命人，看中山大学 23 岁博士确诊胃癌晚期有感", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1232900", "created": 1786172005, "deleted": 0, "content": "农村出身，家里父母都是打工人，好不容易考上名牌大学还直博。就在全家人以为苦尽甘来的时候，命运却给一个相信天道酬勤的人开了一个大大的玩笑。这剧本搁谁身上都免不了要心理奔溃。\r\n\r\n有些人出生就在罗马，有些人虽然出生贫穷但上天给了他逆势翻盘一路打怪升级的剧本，真正苦命的是明明很努力明明已经快要成功了，却被命运突然打断。\r\n\r\n想起以前大学时期也曾经有一位保研的学长被诊断出癌症，家里也是贫苦出身，后面学院里号召大家捐款，可惜最后还是走了。 \r\n\r\n天地不仁，以万物为刍狗。", "content_rendered": "农村出身，家里父母都是打工人，好不容易考上名牌大学还直博。就在全家人以为苦尽甘来的时候，命运却给一个相信天道酬勤的人开了一个大大的玩笑。这剧本搁谁身上都免不了要心理奔溃。<br /><br />有些人出生就在罗马，有些人虽然出生贫穷但上天给了他逆势翻盘一路打怪升级的剧本，真正苦命的是明明很努力明明已经快要成功了，却被命运突然打断。<br /><br />想起以前大学时期也曾经有一位保研的学长被诊断出癌症，家里也是贫苦出身，后面学院里号召大家捐款，可惜最后还是走了。 <br /><br />天地不仁，以万物为刍狗。", "last_modified": 1786172005, "replies": 17, "id": 1232900}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_large.png?m=1733731195", "name": "programmer", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_normal.png?m=1733731195", "title": "程序员", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/programmer", "topics": 72571, "footer": "", "header": "While code monkeys are not eating bananas, they're coding.", "title_alternative": "Programmer", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_mini.png?m=1733731195", "stars": 9749, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 300, "parent_node_name": "computer"}, "member": {"id": 835834, "username": "XIAOemma", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/XIAOemma", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a20dbb08ccdb9959410d7ba375e657cd?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a20dbb08ccdb9959410d7ba375e657cd?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a20dbb08ccdb9959410d7ba375e657cd?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1785997891, "last_modified": 1786160433, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "aiwoshishen", "last_touched": 1786179334, "title": "Claude Code 能不能接便宜点的 Claude 中转？官方有点用不起了", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1232879", "created": 1786161780, "deleted": 0, "content": "最近开始认真用 Claudecode 官方 API 按量算下来有点顶不住。主要是我平时用得比较多，改几个文件、跑几轮测试，就几块十几块出去了有点遭不住\r\n看了一下，很多人会给 ClaudeCode 接中转，但我对这块还不太熟。是直接改 base_url 和 api_key 就行，还是还要改其他配置？模型这块大家一般用 Sonnet 还是 Opus ？\r\n我主要是拿来写代码、看项目，不太想每次用之前还研究半天配置。有没有长期这么用的朋友，分享下你们现在的用法？\r\n如果只是个人开发和日常写代码，一个月大概多少额度比较够用？", "content_rendered": "最近开始认真用 Claudecode 官方 API 按量算下来有点顶不住。主要是我平时用得比较多，改几个文件、跑几轮测试，就几块十几块出去了有点遭不住<br />看了一下，很多人会给 ClaudeCode 接中转，但我对这块还不太熟。是直接改 base_url 和 api_key 就行，还是还要改其他配置？模型这块大家一般用 Sonnet 还是 Opus ？<br />我主要是拿来写代码、看项目，不太想每次用之前还研究半天配置。有没有长期这么用的朋友，分享下你们现在的用法？<br />如果只是个人开发和日常写代码，一个月大概多少额度比较够用？", "last_modified": 1786161780, "replies": 17, "id": 1232879}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/70ef/df2e/17_large.png?m=1660301119", "name": "create", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/70ef/df2e/17_normal.png?m=1660301119", "title": "分享创造", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/create", "topics": 35391, "footer": "", "header": "欢迎你在这里发布自己的最新作品！", "title_alternative": "Create", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/70ef/df2e/17_mini.png?m=1660301119", "stars": 6141, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 17, "parent_node_name": "geek"}, "member": {"id": 305835, "username": "Need4more", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/Need4more", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/19ce/f31a/305835_mini.png?m=1762498606", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/19ce/f31a/305835_normal.png?m=1762498606", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/19ce/f31a/305835_large.png?m=1762498606", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/19ce/f31a/305835_xlarge.png?m=1762498606", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/19ce/f31a/305835_xxlarge.png?m=1762498606", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/19ce/f31a/305835_xxxlarge.png?m=1762498606", "created": 1522766875, "last_modified": 1762498606, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "CocaCola001", "last_touched": 1786179768, "title": "分享一个 ublock origin 规则，屏蔽 x 上的黄色评论", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1232883", "created": 1786163727, "deleted": 0, "content": "x.com##[data-testid=\"tweetText\"]:has-text(/比我骚|没我好看|我的福|我福不黑/):upward(8)\r\n\r\n感兴趣的朋友可以加一下这个规则，文字内容可以自行修改，改善下体验。", "content_rendered": "<p><a href=\"http://x.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">x.com</a>##[data-testid=\"tweetText\"]:has-text(/比我骚|没我好看|我的福|我福不黑/):upward(8)</p>\n<p>感兴趣的朋友可以加一下这个规则，文字内容可以自行修改，改善下体验。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1786163985, "replies": 16, "id": 1232883}]